Package: MATH4753LuciaF26
Title: Train Lateness Distribution Functions for MATH 4753
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Lucia", "Nguyen", email = "lunamiel@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Density, distribution, quantile and random generation functions
    for the train lateness distribution with density 3/500*(25 - y^2) on (-5, 5).
    The functions validate their input, use an exact closed form quantile,
    return summaries such as the mean, variance and tail probabilities,
    and draw ggplot2 plots with shaded tail areas and marked quantiles.
